WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.125 --> 00:00:31.041
In verse 13.22, Lord Krishna explains

2
00:00:31.041 --> 00:00:31.958
how the jivatma

3
00:00:31.958 --> 00:00:35.250
becomes entangled in material existence.

4
00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:36.375
The jivatma is originally

5
00:00:36.375 --> 00:00:39.416
pure and spiritual.

6
00:00:39.416 --> 00:00:40.458
It becomes entangled

7
00:00:40.458 --> 00:00:43.458
through its association with prakriti.

8
00:00:43.458 --> 00:00:45.041
By identifying with the body

9
00:00:45.041 --> 00:00:47.291
and seeking to enjoy the pleasures

10
00:00:47.291 --> 00:00:50.375
arising from the three gunas,

11
00:00:50.375 --> 00:00:51.416
the jivatma

12
00:00:51.416 --> 00:00:53.333
takes birth repeatedly in various

13
00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:55.166
species,

14
00:00:55.166 --> 00:00:57.083
experiencing both favourable

15
00:00:57.083 --> 00:01:00.541
and unfavourable results.

16
00:01:04.958 --> 00:01:06.666
Lord Krishna says,

17
00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:08.958
purushah prakriti-stho hi.

18
00:01:08.958 --> 00:01:10.291
This means

19
00:01:10.291 --> 00:01:14.083
that the jivatma establishes itself

20
00:01:14.083 --> 00:01:16.625
in prakriti by identifying with the body.

21
00:01:16.625 --> 00:01:20.083
This soul is essentially spiritual by nature,

22
00:01:20.083 --> 00:01:21.458
but through illusion

23
00:01:21.458 --> 00:01:23.833
it mistakes itself for the body

24
00:01:23.833 --> 00:01:27.250
and desires to enjoy material things.

25
00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:31.000
This is called bhuńkte prakriti-jan gunan.

26
00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:33.041
Here the soul enjoys or suffers

27
00:01:33.041 --> 00:01:36.416
the products of prakriti's three gunas,

28
00:01:36.416 --> 00:01:40.041
sattva, rajas, and tamas.

29
00:01:40.041 --> 00:01:43.708
That is, sattva gun, raja gun, and tama gun.

30
00:01:43.708 --> 00:01:45.916
Through this guna-sanga,

31
00:01:45.916 --> 00:01:48.125
attachment to the gunas,

32
00:01:48.125 --> 00:01:50.000
the soul becomes bound in the material world.

33
00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:52.291
Just as a person watching a film

34
00:01:52.291 --> 00:01:53.125
becomes emotionally

35
00:01:53.125 --> 00:01:55.791
absorbed in the scenes,

36
00:01:55.791 --> 00:01:56.833
the soul

37
00:01:56.833 --> 00:02:00.041
creates attachment and desires

38
00:02:00.041 --> 00:02:03.541
by identifying with the body
and its experiences.

39
00:02:03.541 --> 00:02:05.125
These attachments lead to

40
00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:08.291
sadasad-yoni-janmasu,

41
00:02:08.291 --> 00:02:10.000
birth in higher

42
00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:12.416
and lower species.

43
00:02:12.416 --> 00:02:13.791
Based on past karma

44
00:02:13.791 --> 00:02:15.250
and the nature of desires,

45
00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:17.208
the soul is placed in different

46
00:02:17.208 --> 00:02:19.000
bodies,

47
00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.416
from devas and humans

48
00:02:20.416 --> 00:02:21.666
to animals

49
00:02:21.666 --> 00:02:22.916
and insects.

50
00:02:22.916 --> 00:02:24.000
Thus the soul

51
00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.083
moves through various species,

52
00:02:26.083 --> 00:02:28.833
sometimes experiencing favourable conditions

53
00:02:28.833 --> 00:02:31.500
and sometimes unfavourable.

54
00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:36.083
A clear example to understand this:

55
00:02:36.083 --> 00:02:39.458
imagine a seed that becomes a tree.

56
00:02:39.458 --> 00:02:42.250
The desire to enjoy material nature

57
00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:43.458
is that seed

58
00:02:43.458 --> 00:02:45.291
which gives birth to the vast

59
00:02:45.291 --> 00:02:47.250
tree of material existence.

60
00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:48.583
The three gunas of prakriti

61
00:02:48.583 --> 00:02:50.500
act like water,

62
00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:52.333
they nourish the seed

63
00:02:52.333 --> 00:02:54.166
and grow the tree.

64
00:02:54.166 --> 00:02:55.625
As long as the soul

65
00:02:55.625 --> 00:02:57.833
nourishes this seed

66
00:02:57.833 --> 00:03:00.875
through material desires, the tree

67
00:03:00.875 --> 00:03:04.208
of material existence continues to flourish.

68
00:03:04.208 --> 00:03:05.875
Lord Krishna explains that

69
00:03:05.875 --> 00:03:08.916
this entanglement can only be removed

70
00:03:08.916 --> 00:03:10.125
by hearing spiritual knowledge

71
00:03:10.125 --> 00:03:12.458
from an authentic source.

72
00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:13.541
Just as Arjuna

73
00:03:13.541 --> 00:03:15.958
is learning directly from Lord Krishna,

74
00:03:15.958 --> 00:03:17.208
Just like

75
00:03:17.208 --> 00:03:19.458
whoever adopts the process of hearing directly

76
00:03:19.458 --> 00:03:21.625
about the Supreme,

77
00:03:21.625 --> 00:03:25.416
gradually finds the desire

78
00:03:25.416 --> 00:03:26.291
to dominate

79
00:03:26.291 --> 00:03:30.166
and enjoy the material world fading from within.

80
00:03:30.166 --> 00:03:31.875
Alongside this, the soul

81
00:03:31.875 --> 00:03:35.208
begins to experience true spiritual joy,

82
00:03:35.208 --> 00:03:39.583
far beyond the temporary
pleasures and sorrows

83
00:03:39.583 --> 00:03:41.125
of the material world.

84
00:03:45.791 --> 00:03:49.666
Have you ever thought about who truly

85
00:03:49.666 --> 00:03:53.000
determines your future,

86
00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:56.833
not just next year or the next job,

87
00:03:56.833 --> 00:04:00.541
but your entire life's journey,

88
00:04:00.541 --> 00:04:04.750
even the journey beyond this life?

89
00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:09.291
In this verse I explain a simple

90
00:04:09.291 --> 00:04:14.083
but deep truth.

91
00:04:14.083 --> 00:04:16.458
Your association with the gunas

92
00:04:16.458 --> 00:04:19.041
of prakriti,

93
00:04:19.041 --> 00:04:22.375
what you think, what you experience,

94
00:04:22.375 --> 00:04:26.000
and what meaning you draw from things,

95
00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:27.916
this is what

96
00:04:27.916 --> 00:04:31.000
determines your path ahead.

97
00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:33.333
If you spend your days

98
00:04:33.333 --> 00:04:37.000
chasing material pleasures,

99
00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.416
constantly desiring comfort,

100
00:04:38.416 --> 00:04:42.000
fame, or indulgence,

101
00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:43.958
you are also sowing seeds

102
00:04:43.958 --> 00:04:48.000
of more such desires.

103
00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:51.583
Think about what the result will be?

104
00:04:51.583 --> 00:04:53.666
More longing for pleasure,

105
00:04:53.666 --> 00:04:56.333
more entanglement, more cycles

106
00:04:56.333 --> 00:04:58.833
of birth and rebirth.

107
00:04:58.833 --> 00:05:02.125
This desire to enjoy without understanding

108
00:05:02.125 --> 00:05:03.291
keeps the soul

109
00:05:03.291 --> 00:05:07.208
locked in an endless cycle.

110
00:05:07.208 --> 00:05:08.708
But

111
00:05:08.708 --> 00:05:11.875
if you begin to see life

112
00:05:11.875 --> 00:05:14.541
through a spiritual lens,

113
00:05:14.541 --> 00:05:17.000
everything changes.

114
00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:21.750
You begin to ask yourself about everything:

115
00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.000
'Is this

116
00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:26.000
truly satisfying me?

117
00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:31.000
Or is it only keeping me busy?'

118
00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:34.083
This is the turning point.

119
00:05:34.083 --> 00:05:36.541
Awareness begins to grow.

120
00:05:36.541 --> 00:05:39.875
Desires begin to settle. And slowly

121
00:05:39.875 --> 00:05:44.041
the fog of illusion begins to lift.

122
00:05:44.041 --> 00:05:46.458
What you think today,

123
00:05:46.458 --> 00:05:48.875
what you value today,

124
00:05:48.875 --> 00:05:51.333
that shapes your tomorrow.

125
00:05:51.333 --> 00:05:54.666
So choose wisely.

126
00:05:54.666 --> 00:05:57.958
Let your heart immerse in what elevates,

127
00:05:57.958 --> 00:06:00.000
not what binds.

128
00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.000
not what binds.

129
00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:05.708
As your inner world changes,

130
00:06:05.708 --> 00:06:10.625
your outer journey follows,

131
00:06:10.625 --> 00:06:13.083
toward freedom,

132
00:06:13.083 --> 00:06:15.083
not repetition.

133
00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:21.750
If you truly wish

134
00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:24.875
to help your children or younger ones

135
00:06:24.875 --> 00:06:29.041
build a meaningful future,

136
00:06:29.041 --> 00:06:32.500
ask what they engage with

137
00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:35.416
every day,

138
00:06:35.416 --> 00:06:38.583
what they listen to, what they watch,

139
00:06:38.583 --> 00:06:44.000
who they follow, who they admire.

140
00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.083
Because

141
00:06:45.083 --> 00:06:49.500
these associations of theirs today

142
00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:52.791
shape their desires, their mindset,

143
00:06:52.791 --> 00:06:56.041
and even their future.

144
00:06:56.041 --> 00:06:58.833
As I explain in this verse,

145
00:06:58.833 --> 00:07:02.166
it is guna-sanga,

146
00:07:02.166 --> 00:07:06.125
our association with the gunas of prakriti,

147
00:07:06.125 --> 00:07:10.708
that determines our journey ahead.

148
00:07:10.708 --> 00:07:14.666
This applies at home too.

149
00:07:14.666 --> 00:07:18.791
If your child is constantly absorbing thoughts

150
00:07:18.791 --> 00:07:20.250
driven by greed, comparison,

151
00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:24.791
or distraction, think about

152
00:07:24.791 --> 00:07:30.000
what kind of life this will lead them toward.

153
00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:32.750
You can transform children,

154
00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:34.625
not through lectures,

155
00:07:34.625 --> 00:07:39.083
but by living in alignment with
the Gita's teachings.

156
00:07:39.083 --> 00:07:41.708
By setting an example,

157
00:07:41.708 --> 00:07:44.791
let them see in you,

158
00:07:44.791 --> 00:07:48.416
the peace that does not depend on devices,

159
00:07:48.416 --> 00:07:52.541
the joy that does not depend on outcomes,

160
00:07:52.541 --> 00:07:57.291
and the depth that comes from spiritual clarity.

161
00:07:57.291 --> 00:08:00.666
When you live the Gita,

162
00:08:00.666 --> 00:08:03.000
you lead by

163
00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.000
example.

164
00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:05.916
Only then

165
00:08:05.916 --> 00:08:09.916
do they begin to value your principles,

166
00:08:09.916 --> 00:08:15.083
not out of fear, but out of respect and inspiration.

167
00:08:15.083 --> 00:08:16.083
And this may be

168
00:08:16.083 --> 00:08:20.250
the greatest gift you give them,

169
00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:23.416
not just a good present,

170
00:08:23.416 --> 00:08:26.958
but a bright future.

171
00:08:31.458 --> 00:08:36.208
In your professional journey,
it is easy to think that

172
00:08:36.208 --> 00:08:40.500
success depends only on luck, timing,

173
00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:44.500
or your network.

174
00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:47.791
But pause for a moment

175
00:08:47.791 --> 00:08:51.041
and reflect on this.

176
00:08:51.041 --> 00:08:54.125
What you receive in life

177
00:08:54.125 --> 00:08:58.500
is the result of your daily thinking,

178
00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:01.458
the choices you made

179
00:09:01.458 --> 00:09:03.333
when they mattered,

180
00:09:03.333 --> 00:09:05.916
and where your mental engagement lies.

181
00:09:05.916 --> 00:09:09.500
In this verse I explain

182
00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:11.041
that the soul

183
00:09:11.041 --> 00:09:12.791
becomes entangled in various experiences

184
00:09:12.791 --> 00:09:15.000
based on its association

185
00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:18.666
with material nature,

186
00:09:18.666 --> 00:09:21.291
guna-sanga.

187
00:09:21.291 --> 00:09:24.833
In the same way, in your professional life,

188
00:09:24.833 --> 00:09:27.416
your growth, your happiness, and your direction

189
00:09:27.416 --> 00:09:30.208
are determined by

190
00:09:30.208 --> 00:09:33.458
what you choose to associate with,

191
00:09:33.458 --> 00:09:38.250
your habits, your mindset, your work ethic,

192
00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:43.541
and the people you choose to keep close.

193
00:09:43.541 --> 00:09:45.250
What are you choosing,

194
00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:47.375
clarity or confusion?

195
00:09:47.375 --> 00:09:49.125
Growth or comfort?

196
00:09:49.125 --> 00:09:50.583
The longer path of integrity

197
00:09:50.583 --> 00:09:54.750
or the convenient shortcut?

198
00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:57.000
Every decision you make,

199
00:09:57.000 --> 00:10:00.583
even the smallest one,

200
00:10:00.583 --> 00:10:02.708
sows a seed.

201
00:10:02.708 --> 00:10:06.916
And just as seeds become trees,

202
00:10:06.916 --> 00:10:10.458
your decisions build your future.

203
00:10:10.458 --> 00:10:13.250
If you want change,

204
00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:17.500
begin with your inner associations.

205
00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:19.875
Cultivate thoughts in the soil of the mind

206
00:10:19.875 --> 00:10:23.500
that lift you higher.

207
00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:26.958
Surround yourself with colleagues

208
00:10:26.958 --> 00:10:29.208
who inspire you.

209
00:10:29.208 --> 00:10:32.125
Connect your work to values

210
00:10:32.125 --> 00:10:35.291
that give you peace.

211
00:10:35.291 --> 00:10:39.625
Remember, you are not powerless.

212
00:10:39.625 --> 00:10:43.500
You yourself are a participant in building

213
00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:45.541
your own future.

214
00:10:45.541 --> 00:10:49.000
Today's decisions are quietly

215
00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:53.125
writing the script of your tomorrow.

216
00:10:53.125 --> 00:10:55.250
Understand this,

217
00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:58.125
choose wisely today,

218
00:10:58.125 --> 00:11:01.208
and you will shape an excellent
future for tomorrow.
